"`$XONSH_HISTORY_SIZE <envvars.html#xonsh-history-size>`_, "
"`$XONSH_STORE_STDOUT <envvars.html#xonsh-store-stdout>`_, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../history_backend.rst:311
msgid ""
